### Tourism Management System (TMS) REST API Test Collection

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1
@customerToken = {{loginCustomer.response.body.token}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Register New Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Travel",
  "email": "jane.travel@test.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phone": "+91 9123456789"
}

### 3. Login as Admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tms.test",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 4. Login as Customer
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@tms.test",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 5. Login with Deactivated User (Should Return 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deactivated@tms.test",
  "password": "Deactivated@123"
}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Customer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 7. RBAC Security Check: Customer accessing Admin route (Should Return 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 8. RBAC Security Check: Admin accessing Admin route (Should Return 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Forgot Password Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@tms.test"
}

### 10. Update Profile (Name & Phone)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma (Updated)",
  "phone": "+91 9999911111"
}
